# Phase 13 – Step 1: allow-list for the image build context.
# Everything is excluded except what the app needs, so .env, tests, cassettes, logs,
# experiments and the virtualenv can never end up in the image.
*
!app.py
!requirements.txt
!.streamlit/
!agentsville/
!data/
!prompts/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
